  ~ called by: Server.SaleCommand.saleCommandServer, Server.Transaction.saleServer, Server.Transaction.refundServer, Server.Transaction.reservationServer, Server.Transaction.registerServer, Server.Transaction.ledgerServer, Server.Transaction.complianceServer

