  ~ called by: Server.SaleCommand.saleCommandServer, Server.Transaction.requireCapability, Server.Transaction.requireSaleWriter, Server.Transaction.saleServer, Server.Transaction.refundServer, Server.Transaction.reservationServer, Server.Transaction.registerServer

